 R←Test_SendEmail_03(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕IO;⎕ML;⎕TRAP;parms;rc;msg;log;text;filename;parts
⍝ Send an email with a single attachment that contains APL characters
 ⎕IO←1 ⋄ ⎕ML←1
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 parms←∆NewMail'Subject from APL Team SMTP: ',⊃⎕SI
 parms.Body←'Simple text'
 filename←'./Test-Files/CrashReport.html'
 parms.AddAttachment filename'text/html'
 (rc msg log text)←∆Send parms
 →T.PassesIf 0=rc
 parts←∆MimeParts ∆Unstuff text
 →T.PassesIf 2=≢parts
 →T.PassesIf(⊂'Simple text')∊1⊃parts
 →T.PassesIf'Content-Type: text/html;'≡24↑⊃2⊃parts
 →T.PassesIf(∆ReadBytes filename)≡∆PartBytes 2⊃parts

 R←T._OK
⍝Done
